traces.inference_trace:
Track the index of the previous 1. When the next 1 appears at index i, there are `i - prev - 1` zeros between them. If that count is less than k, return false.

```csharp
public class Solution {
    public bool KLengthApart(int[] nums, int k) {
        int prev = -1;
        for (int i = 0; i < nums.Length; i++) {
            if (nums[i] == 1) {
                if (prev != -1 && i - prev - 1 < k) return false;
                prev = i;
            }
        }
        return true;
    }
}
```

