traces.inference_trace:
This is a row-by-row bitmask DP over seat placements.

For each row, enumerate the masks that fit the row:
- Every set bit must sit on a good seat (`'.'`).
- No two set bits are adjacent, i.e. `mask & (mask >> 1) == 0`.

A mask `cur` in row `i` is compatible with the previous row's mask `prev` when:
- `cur & (prev << 1) == 0`, so no student sits at the upper left of another.
- `cur & (prev >> 1) == 0`, so no student sits at the upper right of another.

The transition is `dp[i][cur] = max(dp[i-1][prev]) + popcount(cur)`, taken over valid `prev`. Invalid masks are marked -1 in the DP array. The starting state is `prev = 0` with value 0 for the virtual row before the first. The answer is the maximum value in the last row.

The seat character may be `'.'` or `'#'`; the examples show trailing spaces, but the actual `char[]` entries are single characters, so I compare directly against `'#'` to detect broken seats.

```csharp
public class Solution {
    public int MaxStudents(char[][] seats) {
        int m = seats.Length;
        int n = seats[0].Length;
        int size = 1 << n;
        int[] dp = new int[size];
        for (int i = 0; i < size; i++) dp[i] = -1;
        dp[0] = 0;
        for (int r = 0; r < m; r++) {
            int bad = 0;
            for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {
                if (seats[r][j] == '#') bad |= 1 << j;
            }
            int[] nd = new int[size];
            for (int i = 0; i < size; i++) nd[i] = -1;
            for (int cur = 0; cur < size; cur++) {
                if ((cur & bad) != 0) continue;
                if ((cur & (cur >> 1)) != 0) continue;
                int cnt = 0;
                for (int t = cur; t > 0; t &= t - 1) cnt++;
                int best = -1;
                for (int prev = 0; prev < size; prev++) {
                    if (dp[prev] < 0) continue;
                    if ((cur & (prev << 1)) != 0) continue;
                    if ((cur & (prev >> 1)) != 0) continue;
                    if (dp[prev] > best) best = dp[prev];
                }
                if (best >= 0) nd[cur] = best + cnt;
            }
            dp = nd;
        }
        int ans = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < size; i++) if (dp[i] > ans) ans = dp[i];
        return ans;
    }
}
```

